From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vendomat Fork <vendomat-fork@users.noreply.invalid>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] vendomat: type machines.<name>.nixos as a deferred module

`machines.<name>.nixos` used `nullOr unspecified`, which cannot merge two
definitions. Use `nullOr deferredModule` so that an attribute set, a
function, and a default module all merge into one NixOS module. Leave the
`home-manager` and `nix-darwin` option types as upstream has them.

Upstream: none (Vendomat module fork; R34: no upstream pull request)
---
 src/modules/machines.nix | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/modules/machines.nix b/src/modules/machines.nix
index 69df84dfc3c07b4e807363692098f107b87ce507..6b0732a2645610411ce68b1b62dceec74e367b80 100644
--- a/src/modules/machines.nix
+++ b/src/modules/machines.nix
@@ -299,7 +299,7 @@ let
       };
 
       nixos = lib.mkOption {
-        type = lib.types.nullOr lib.types.unspecified;
+        type = lib.types.nullOr lib.types.deferredModule;
         description = "NixOS configuration for the machine.";
         default = null;
         example = lib.literalExpression ''
